Z||000002||rogergarrison||02-16-2001||02:07 AM||||Id say..........mmmm gold. sorry couldnt resist (joke) Ive never done a set so I honestly cant say. If no one knows you could compare chips at auto paint store for a match. Most have a book also of 'fleet' colors where the colors are arranged by hues like a rainbow.(ie, all the reds, golds, etc are arranged with each other from litest to darkest shades)<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 02-16-2001).]||||reg||1
